    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting someone else carry it\" ... i don't know. i don't have anyone. and even if i did, it doesn't change the fact that i'm the one who keeps failing. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be quiet and still, without having to deal with the guilt or the relapse or the exhaustion. like, if the fighting is just pointless, then isn't there a kind of peace in just stopping for good?",
